<title>FRANCE: Egypt seeks 50,000 tonnes of French wheat - trade.</title>
<headline>Egypt seeks 50,000 tonnes of French wheat - trade.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt will tender on September 13 for the import of 50,000 tonnes of French soft wheat for shipment between October 15 and October 31, European grain traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
